			<div class="content" id="post-content-1515356">
									

<p>I liked it and gave it my vote:<br />
One suggestion as to tone in the testing log (its up to you)</p>
<p>Instead of having the subject speak folksily, have him be more well-spoken:</p>
<p>In other words, instead of this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Subject: Nothin so far Doc. I’m just kind of bored sittin here is all. Couldn’t you've thrown in a TV or a magazine or something?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I would go with something like this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Subject: Nothing I can tell, doctor. I'm bored sitting here that's all. I would have appreciated a TV or a magazine.</p>
</blockquote>

